      <h3 id="session-transcripts" class="group scroll-mt-20">Session transcripts<a href="#session-transcripts" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h3>
      <p>The audit log records what the agent did, and the transcript records the conversation. The log identifies the command that touched each file. The transcript contains your requests and the agent's responses.</p>
      <p>Each conversation with the built-in agent is a file in <code>~/.xagent/sessions</code>, outside the project, so nothing reaches the team repository.</p>
      <p>Select <strong>Sessions</strong> in the AI Agent panel, or type <code>/sessions</code>, to see every session with its date and name. You can resume a session, start a new one, or delete one. You cannot delete the conversation in progress because the agent is still writing to it.</p>
